WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “AI assistant & knowledge base”, then open the “Knowledge Base” tab.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Add knowledge
Open the knowledge base and add your business information and accurate questions and answers.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Review the content
Delete outdated information and complete missing answers; the assistant relies on this knowledge.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Set up the assistant
Open the AI assistant settings and review the available options, then try customer questions to check the answers.
